﻿1
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.480
Lamentablemente, esto aún no ha terminado.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.160
We only postponed it.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:05.920
But don't worry.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.200
We will get through this.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.080
I will help you with the paintings.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.880
And why are you being so kind,

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.000
so desperate to help me?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.640
Are you trying to make up for the

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.120
delightful evening you had

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.160
with Christina?

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.960
Veronica, no. It’s not what you...

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.440
Yes, it's exactly that.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.400
You know, I...

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.760
honestly thought you were different.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.360
My mistake.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.920
You’re cut from the same cloth

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.680
as your jerk of a brother!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.160
I invited Christina to my room

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.160
on purpose

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.520
to keep her away from intercepting

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.040
your paintings.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.160
Or did you think Latina

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.000
was only bargaining with you?

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.240
What?
